WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
A blast furnace is
taller than a house,

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.970
and it runs day and night.

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:10.190
Into the top go three solids:
iron ore, coke and limestone.

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.750
Hot air is blasted in at the bottom.

5
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.550
Out of the bottom pours molten iron.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.030
But here's the puzzle.

7
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.870
The limestone never
ends up in the iron.

8
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.850
None of it.

9
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.290
So why go to the trouble
of putting it in?

10
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.870
In this mission, you'll see how
burning coke heats the furnace

11
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.570
and makes carbon monoxide.

12
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:32.650
You'll find out how carbon monoxide
takes the oxygen from iron

13
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.830
oxide.

14
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.930
And you'll follow the
limestone to see what it does.

15
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:41.470
Your mission: explain why
limestone goes into the furnace.
